{"availability":"available","full":"saintparish4/openscript","name":"openscript","description":"Security gateway for LLM agents. A policy pipeline that blocks prompt injection, redacts PII and secrets, firewalls tool calls and holds risky actions for human approval. Nine pure-local policies, measured against labelled corpora. The live demo runs the real package in your browser via WebAssembly — nothing leaves the tab.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-01-28T04:20:51Z","updated":"2026-10-15T17:38:01Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://openscript-rho.vercel.app/","topics":["ai-agents","ai-safety","guardrails","llm-security","prompt-injection","pyodide","python","webassembly"],"demo":"https://openscript-rho.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:18.636Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:18.636Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:18.636Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:44:24.351Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T07:32:26.648Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T07:03:23.581Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:46:18.636Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Security gateway SDK for LLM/agent workflows. Block prompt injection, redact PII and secrets, firewall tool calls, gate risky actions behind human approval, and score every action's risk — across any LLM provider.","OpenScript wraps any agent in a policy pipeline: policies run before and after every action, and each one can allow, mutate (redact), deny, or require human approval. The pipeline itself contains zero detection logic — everything is a Policy you can swap, configure from YAML, or write yourself."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/saintparish4/openscript/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"17a41e84829fb1f434f44c42ce823fee4895c2d12a9e890e5783d3dd8e8ed1ba","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44: